      ms: 6480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1bxaro4'
    'female|a||And averaged over all twelve years from 1989 to 2000, the gap is almost twenty packs a year: about a quarter of what synthetic California bought.':
