      ms: 11000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:4tki02'
    female|a||No standard error comes with that number. How sure we can be is a question of its own, and it needs its own trick.:
