      ms: 9760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1hc79me'
    female|a||Third, the weights that matched nineteen years before the tax would have kept matching after it.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 6040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1v4ay1o'
    'female|a||One more caveat: sales are counted from tax paid, so smuggling would look like less smoking. The authors argue California is too far from cheap states for that to matter much.':
