      ms: 11800
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:4yj4a8'
    female|a||Of all this, the main thing we can check against data is the fit before 1989.:
