      ms: 13760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:9ybtq5'
    'female|a||Little: a blend that cannot reproduce the past it was fitted to may simply go on missing after 1995, and the gap would show that miss, not the law.':
