      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:17l01tr'
    female|a||In a trial, a standard error answers that. Oregon's 2008 Medicaid lottery, for one, drew thousands of names at random, so the play of chance could be measured.:
